Third-party models
------------------
Gist loads the following pretrained models at runtime. Their weights are not
distributed with this repository; each is downloaded from its publisher and
is governed by its own licence.

- CLIP (openai/clip-vit-base-patch32), OpenAI. MIT License.
- CLAP (laion/clap-htsat-unfused), LAION. Apache License 2.0.
- Whisper via faster-whisper, OpenAI / SYSTRAN. MIT License.
- all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (sentence-transformers). Apache License 2.0.
- Qwen2.5-VL-3B-Instruct and Qwen2.5-Omni-7B, Alibaba Cloud Qwen team.
  See each model card for its licence terms.

